// IntroString :
"P3110484250" "The Sky Raiders have taken on a nasty little mercenary job. It seems they've raided the Webber Pharmaceuticals building, and they're planning on gutting the place with firebombs! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop that Sky Raider bombing.</A> You only have 75 minutes to deal with the Sky Raiders. <br><br> One more thing: I've learned that Lt. {BOSS_NAME} is running this operation. I want him taken into custody; otherwise, he'll only try theses same tricks again. If {BOSS_NAME} escapes, this mission will be a failure."
// AcceptString :
"P1583848211" "Stop the Sky Raider bombing"
// SendOffString :
"P1741101703" "{BOSS_NAME} is known for his wiliness; don't underestimate him, {HeroName}."
