"P366374608" "That had to be nerve wracking, {HeroName}. According to the Sky Raiders you arrested, this was all about a patent infringement. It seems Webber Pharmaceuticals tread on some powerful toes when they took their last product to market. The only information I couldn't get was the name of the company that ordered the hit."
// RandomFameString :
"P3916945760" "I heard {HeroName} was thinking of joining the bomb squad."

