// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_SkyRaiders_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1733131837" "Have you heard of the mercenaries who call themselves the Sky Raiders? According to my sources, they're planning to raid the labs of Balsim Technologies. The Sky Raiders are always on the lookout for new weapons technology, and Balsim's highly publicized Cryonite Armor is certainly an appealing target. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to stop them before they can make off Balsim's designs.</a> You only have 75 minutes to repel the Sky Raiders."
// AcceptString :
"P799368469" "Stop the Sky Raiders before they can make off with Balsim's designs"
// SendOffString :
"P1378049864" "If you can lock down Balsim's computer network, you should be able to stop the Sky Raiders from accessing the designs for the Cryonite Armor."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P451764361" "Defeat all Sky Raiders in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3676994168" "If the Sky Raiders get their hands on that armor, it'll be bad news for everyone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P447208612" "The security system shrieks a futile warning."

