// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1352034682" "Sky Raider services are always for sale to the highest bidder. If it wasn't for you, they would have become the most fearsome mercenaries on the planet. Excellent work, {HeroName}. As a thank you, Balsim Technologies sent over a prototype for the Cryonite Armor they've been developing. They'd like you to be the first to test it in the field."
// RandomFameString :
"P188239453" "{HeroName} stopped a the Sky Raiders cold at Balsim Technologies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2126735722" "The Sky Raiders have all of the information they need to reproduce Balsim's Cryonite Armor. We'll have to work even harder to contain the threat they pose. My real worry is that those designs will show up on the black market. I guess we'll have to keep our eyes peeled, right, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_SkyRaiders_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P144391596" "The Sky Raiders mercenary tactics make them one of the most dangerous groups in the city. Because their services are for sale, we can never anticipate their next target. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think it's best if we discourage the Sky Raiders from any more attacks in Paragon City. </a>The best way to do that is to take the fight to the streets."
// AcceptString :
"P804177643" "Discourage the Sky Raiders' attacks"
// SendOffString :
"P4086418212" "Remember, all the Sky Raiders have military training. They can be very dangerous men."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3648235160" "Combat Sky Raider menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2329972201" "I really want you to make an impression on the Sky Raiders, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2736740871" "You can't compete with our tactics, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2295013252" "This Antigravity Matrix should let you fly for a short time. That way you can keep up with the Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1815170861" "You have discouraged the Sky Raiders' attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2344799912" "A series of defeats like those should make the Sky Raiders think twice about keeping up their criminal activities. Good work, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P934650792" "Did you see {HeroName} go after the Sky Raiders? Those goons are grounded!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_SkyRaiders_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P77164835" "The Sky Raiders' raids on Terra Volta have all of the city on edge. They've been taking and holding territory all over the zone. In fact, they're using Terra Volta as the staging area for all of their attacks throughout the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like to see a hero show them Terra Volta isn't their personal property.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3149811390" "Show the Sky Raiders Terra Volta isn't their personal property"
// SendOffString :
"P2031229342" "The Sky Raiders have been setting up staging areas near Coroman Manufacturing and Challenger Technology."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2528632028" "Combat Sky Raiders in Terra Volta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P857796415" "You need to show the Sky Raiders that Paragon City's heroes don't back down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3119934280" "You have decreased the Sky Raiders' territory in Terra Volta."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P231066626" "The Terra Volta security guards reported a drop Sky Raider efficiency almost the moment you got on the scene. Good work, {HeroName}."
